{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1c9c23a940dd525485e708691226cda5f6ae89dc1a51a610109d88c27fb8d6f8", "ja": "（茜考案のテーマパーク『にゃんにゃんパーク』が\nオープン！　たくさんの人が来園し、大盛況だ！）", "zh": "（茜设计的主题公园“喵喵公园”开业了！许多人前来游玩，现场盛况空前！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "e2c973b059ac70440aa28ddb3a7d96401727d82668b8d38b42ecf1fa6e3bcb5b", "ja": "おっ！　{$P$}ちゃん発見～！\n『茜ちゃんランド』は楽しんでるかニャン？", "zh": "哦！发现{$P$}啦～！\n在『小茜乐园』玩得开心吗，喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d621133e0eef23713d349cf86616ca484423c638e5e38938ab8f2b62f84fb615", "ja": "『茜ちゃんランド』？\n名前は統一してほしいが……まあ、いいか。", "zh": "“小茜乐园”？名字最好统一一下……不过，也无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4682cc40b2b733d2adf1a643e021ff8e5238e75f04057fd1be4856a7dd85a719", "ja": "少し見てきたけど、どのエリアも盛り上がってるな。\nみんな楽しそうだし。よく頑張ったな、茜。", "zh": "我稍微看了一圈，每个区域都很热闹呢。\n大家也玩得很开心的样子。你真的很努力了，茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "8bec16b45b380c5b708cb673b4a22f897e24fb98a56a41d1ad57b8bd6e31541f", "ja": "ニャハハ！　これくらい当然だよ、\n{$P$}ちゃん！　でもでも……。", "zh": "喵哈哈！这点小事当然啦，\n{$P$}！不过不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "0c1dae4a6109be8faef3d717174f3ac177f1c34062f95a1d63a4055d67e3d733", "ja": "『茜ちゃんランド』はまだまだ終わらないのだ～！\nほら、{$P$}ちゃんも遊ぶよ！", "zh": "『小茜乐园』还远远没有结束呢～！\n来吧，{$P$}也一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6f93e0afcf57e1284ce1e1f705718e086170cfc86981ff8d762d62eb9424df1c", "ja": "今からか？　……そうだな。閉園まで時間はあるし、\nせっかくだから遊んでいこうかな。", "zh": "现在就去吗？……也是，离闭园还有时间，那就难得来一趟，一起玩到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "08d9eb7367d081012a1555711f35e0006b31b538c93eef70d81cbfab52b4e4e0", "ja": "やったー！　じゃあ、メリーゴーラウンドに乗ろうよ！\n一日園長の茜ちゃんが案内してあげるね♪", "zh": "太好了！那我们去坐旋转木马吧！\n由一日园长的小茜来给你带路哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9f695e71f65bc267b8fe602ada9934bce1551355ed1fb0f783d38596fa050434", "ja": "案内って、仕事は終わったんだから、\n茜もお客さんになって楽しんでいいんだぞ。", "zh": "既然导览的工作已经结束了，茜也可以当游客好好享受啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "68ef7bc02d8e0dbf76cdc1f68763e41251237a630ad65ffac81421a47a2ce9b8", "ja": "心配してくれて、ありがと。でもね……\n茜ちゃん、園長のお仕事チョー楽しかったんだ。", "zh": "谢谢你替我担心。不过呢……\n小茜，园长的工作超级开心的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "d7daa16f335270845d5f033a8a7baba2b8aa9ed70b9e36555695ac2e3c9dcb66", "ja": "だから最後の最後まで、『茜ちゃんランド』の園長で\nいたい。っていうか、いさせて！", "zh": "所以直到最后最后，我都想当『小茜乐园』的园长。应该说，请让我当下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c6c35a886ac150964b54e14bbb82db496c9119e43ba1656178a3a55959f4e1ce", "ja": "茜……。わかったよ。\n園長として最後のひと仕事、お願いしようかな。", "zh": "茜……知道了。那就请你以园长的身份，再做最后一件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "da58772171023491a24c342538087b471ede941ae52bd674662a39084738a83d", "ja": "うん！　でも……これで本当に終わっちゃうんだよね。\nもっとたくさんの人に楽しんでもらいたかったな。", "zh": "嗯！可是……这样就真的要结束了呢。\n真希望能让更多的人享受到快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "c3aee16677cf8752938dca4e1a149c9d5a19bb56dcbd23999437cd38dbf7ebe4", "ja": "一日限りってのはもったいないから……そうだ！\n『茜ちゃんランド』を永久に続けるのはどう？", "zh": "只办一天太可惜了……对了！\n要不要让『小茜乐园』永久延续下去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fa459e9c83d31d2854db510bd2da87a0ace0e5e86319f49e5fc25db2dc07eeba", "ja": "そうだな。永久は難しいけど……。\nまた茜がこの仕事をできるように検討してみるよ。", "zh": "是啊。永久持续下去有点困难，不过……我会考虑让茜以后还能再做这份工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "5ae3d58328788d3034d4ced0f65a8f0649f135442e8cef4a1691988fe6c7fc84", "ja": "ホント！？　さすが{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃん、期待して待ってるね！", "zh": "真的！？不愧是{$P$}！\n我会满怀期待地等着小茜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1016_p", "source_sha256": "347afdf511b9aa078b4874bbcd96c100ea1f3cbb68bc768b33b3d96dba22efab", "ja": "ああ、最大限努力する。\nけど、茜の協力も必要だからな？", "zh": "啊，我会尽最大努力。\n不过，也需要茜的协助才行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "dd760ff372c40f98edc65d51f49e79e467d481a73561ca92a00b468007d51d4a", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　もっともっと愛されキャラになって、\n今度は、名誉園長としてカムバックしてみせます！", "zh": "那是当然啦！茜会变得越来越受欢迎，\n下次一定会作为名誉园长华丽回归的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "69be81dc284853e0471185561495e2f108eb61b15c439ae7ddc7dc3946aa6f35", "ja": "そして『茜ちゃんランド』を、もっともっと愛される\n一大テーマパークにしてみせるからね！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "而且，我一定会把『小茜乐园』变成更加更加受大家喜爱的大型主题乐园！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0333_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e376defa17c49b6d8216049b567bc865e509552ea558ff3abecae13393a3400b", "ja": "（茜の誰かを楽しませたいという欲望に際限はない。\nその期待に応えられるように、俺も頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（茜那种想让别人开心的欲望没有止境。为了回应这份期待，我也要努力才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
